Q1. Write a program to find Maximum between two numbers.
A)
import java.util.Scanner;
public class TernaryPractice {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);

        // Q1. Maximum between two numbers
        System.out.print("Enter two numbers: ");
        int a = sc.nextInt();
        int b = sc.nextInt();
        int max2 = (a > b) ? a : b;
        System.out.println("Maximum of two numbers: " + max2);
    }
}

Q2. Write a program to find Maximum between three numbers.
A)
import java.util.Scanner;
public class TernaryPractice {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);

        System.out.print("Enter three numbers: ");
        int x = sc.nextInt();
        int y = sc.nextInt();
        int z = sc.nextInt();
        int max3 = (x > y) ? ((x > z) ? x : z) : ((y > z) ? y : z);
        System.out.println("Maximum of three numbers: " + max3);
    }
}

Q3. Write a program to check whether a charter is alphabetic or not .
A).
import java.util.Scanner;
